  "dialogueList": [
    {
      "dialogue": {
        "EncounterObjectGuid": "73df8d9c-a274-48fd-98c9-2bd0d7860e83"
      },
      "name": "Dialogue_MissionStart",
      "overrideDialogueBucketId": "",
      "dialogueContent": [
        {
          "words": "根据这些勘测地图，你应该能从这个位置看到车队的路线。",
          "wordsColor": {
            "r": 1,
            "g": 1,
            "b": 1,
            "a": 1
          },
          "selectedCastDefId": "castDef_DariusDefault",
          "emote": "Default",
          "audioName": "NONE",
          "cameraFocusGuid": "cb50e1e4-aa0c-49b2-bd2e-5339c78dafb5",
          "cameraDistance": "Far",
          "cameraHeight": "Default",
          "revealRadius": -1
        },
        {
          "words": "一旦你看到了它们，就摧毁车辆。其它单位悉听尊便，但应该没太多反抗。",
          "wordsColor": {
            "r": 1,
            "g": 1,
            "b": 1,
            "a": 1
          },
          "selectedCastDefId": "castDef_DariusDefault",
          "emote": "Default",
          "audioName": "NONE",
          "cameraFocusGuid": "cb50e1e4-aa0c-49b2-bd2e-5339c78dafb5",
          "cameraDistance": "Far",
          "cameraHeight": "Default",
          "revealRadius": -1
        },
        {
          "words": "最后老生常谈。指挥官，等你准备好接应了，我就会在这个着陆区和你碰头。",
          "wordsColor": {
            "r": 1,
            "g": 1,
            "b": 1,
            "a": 1
          },
          "selectedCastDefId": "castDef_SumireDefault",
          "emote": "Default",
          "audioName": "NONE",
          "cameraFocusGuid": "a85da736-7a2e-4cc6-aff3-feb9d73fc7e1",
          "cameraDistance": "Far",
          "cameraHeight": "Default",
          "revealRadius": -1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "dialogue": {
        "EncounterObjectGuid": "4011a4c3-cba2-4d22-b2b3-3b19a3297ab9"
      },
      "name": "Dialogue_MissionSuccess",
      "overrideDialogueBucketId": "",
      "dialogueContent": [
        {
          "words": "达吕斯，我们需要谈谈那个你所说的，“敌人不太多”，到底是什么意思。",
          "wordsColor": {
            "r": 1,
            "g": 1,
            "b": 1,
            "a": 1
          },
          "selectedCastDefId": "castDef_SumireDefault",
          "emote": "Default",
          "audioName": "NONE",
          "cameraFocusGuid": "",
          "cameraDistance": "Far",
          "cameraHeight": "Default",
          "revealRadius": -1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "dialogue": {
        "EncounterObjectGuid": "d3d33d95-9ed7-4686-b9eb-954ebe51cc02"
      },
      "name": "Dialogue_MissionFailure",
      "overrideDialogueBucketId": "",
      "dialogueContent": [
        {
          "words": "这份合约已证明比我们受引导而相信的那样还要刺激的多。",
          "wordsColor": {
            "r": 1,
            "g": 1,
            "b": 1,
            "a": 1
          },
          "selectedCastDefId": "castDef_DariusDefault",
          "emote": "Default",
          "audioName": "NONE",
          "cameraFocusGuid": "",
          "cameraDistance": "Far",
          "cameraHeight": "Default",
          "revealRadius": -1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "dialogue": {
        "EncounterObjectGuid": "2bc99c34-b9a1-4e6d-ad33-a64162819bd0"
      },
      "name": "Dialogue_GoToComplete",
      "overrideDialogueBucketId": "DialogBucketDef_AmbushConvoy_EyesOnTarget",
      "dialogueContent": [
        {
          "words": "已锁定目标车辆。它们应该在你正前方。交战并摧毁，指挥官。",
          "wordsColor": {
            "r": 1,
            "g": 1,
            "b": 1,
            "a": 1
          },
          "selectedCastDefId": "castDef_DariusDefault",
          "emote": "Default",
          "audioName": "NONE",
          "cameraFocusGuid": "",
          "cameraDistance": "Far",
          "cameraHeight": "Default",
          "revealRadius": -1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "dialogue": {
        "EncounterObjectGuid": "7cd7f943-20e7-4b74-9a3c-e1d0cfc30fd9"
      },
      "name": "Dialogue_ConvoyDamaged",
      "overrideDialogueBucketId": "DialogBucketDef_AmbushConvoy_PriTarDamaged",
      "dialogueContent": [
        {
          "words": "打中了，继续攻击那些目标直到将其消灭。",
          "wordsColor": {
            "r": 1,
            "g": 1,
            "b": 1,
            "a": 1
          },
          "selectedCastDefId": "castDef_DariusDefault",
          "emote": "Default",
          "audioName": "NONE",
          "cameraFocusGuid": "",
          "cameraDistance": "Far",
          "cameraHeight": "Default",
          "revealRadius": -1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "dialogue": {
        "EncounterObjectGuid": "a50ad243-225a-4beb-9317-d7aeffa2bcdc"
      },
      "name": "Dialogue_Interrupt_GuardsDestroyed",
      "overrideDialogueBucketId": "",
      "dialogueContent": [
        {
          "words": "两支满编小队？我会说那比我们误以为的敌人要多上不少。",
          "wordsColor": {
            "r": 1,
            "g": 1,
            "b": 1,
            "a": 1
          },
          "selectedCastDefId": "castDef_SumireDefault",
          "emote": "Default",
          "audioName": "NONE",
          "cameraFocusGuid": "",
          "cameraDistance": "Far",
          "cameraHeight": "Default",
          "revealRadius": -1
        },
        {
          "words": "是的。这明显是个陷阱，我们的雇主要我们掉进去。指挥官，在我联系我们的{TEAM_EMP.FactionDef.Demonym}联络人的时候清理那支车队。",
          "wordsColor": {
            "r": 1,
            "g": 1,
            "b": 1,
            "a": 1
          },
          "selectedCastDefId": "castDef_DariusDefault",
          "emote": "Default",
          "audioName": "NONE",
          "cameraFocusGuid": "",
          "cameraDistance": "Far",
          "cameraHeight": "Default",
          "revealRadius": -1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "dialogue": {
        "EncounterObjectGuid": "793629ec-2233-4559-988b-460c5fdf6d58"
      },
      "name": "Dialogue_Interrupt_ConvoyReachedExtraction",
      "overrideDialogueBucketId": "",
      "dialogueContent": [
        {
          "words": "头儿，那些车辆就要离开作战区域了。要是跟丢了，我们就拿不到钱。",
          "wordsColor": {
            "r": 1,
            "g": 1,
            "b": 1,
            "a": 1
          },
          "selectedCastDefId": "castDef_SumireDefault",
          "emote": "Default",
          "audioName": "NONE",
          "cameraFocusGuid": "3560382a-c082-4a0b-8cab-8e6327b74cce",
          "cameraDistance": "Far",
          "cameraHeight": "Default",
          "revealRadius": -1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "dialogue": {
        "EncounterObjectGuid": "366443c6-7895-4b4c-aea9-544f1a88c43e"
      },
      "name": "Dialogue_ConvoyTargetDestroyed",
      "overrideDialogueBucketId": "DialogBucketDef_AmbushConvoy_PriTarDamaged",
      "dialogueContent": [
        {
          "words": "解决一个。继续压制这些威胁，我们就能离开这里。",
